programs.sol:
"""A lexical completion/totality detector, not a general end-of-sentence signal.

Complete (even incomplete) is strongest; finish, full, and successful are
weaker. Chinese/Japanese 完 words behave similarly. Competition words are
weaker spelling neighbors. Carry joins split spellings and preserves a short
echo on articles after completion words. Other activations are omitted.
"""
